OL,3,CStudy could shed light on declines in
OL,4,Cred grouse populations, experts say
OL,6,FA new study could shed light on why
OL,7,Fred grouse populations in Scotland
OL,8,Fhave declined over recent years,
OL,9,Fconservationists have said.
OL,11,FPopulations of the distinctive upland
OL,12,Fbird have seen a series of sharp
OL,13,Fdeclines over the last 10 years.
OL,15,FThere have been several widespread
OL,16,Fbreeding failures and sharp declines
OL,17,Facross grouse moors managed under a
OL,18,Frange of different systems.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
