PN,30902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786506479
OL,3,CStudy could shed light on declines in
OL,4,Cred grouse populations, experts say
OL,6,FMonitoring by the Game & Wildlife
OL,7,FConservation Trust (GWCT) showed a
OL,8,Fpoor 2024 breeding season led to an
OL,9,Faverage 40% drop in pair counts across
OL,10,FEngland and a 34% decline in Scotland.
OL,12,FSummer brood counts then revealed a
OL,13,Ffurther fall in the number of adult
OL,14,Fbirds, with a 36% drop in England and
OL,15,F29% in Scotland.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786506479
OL,3,CStudy could shed light on declines in
OL,4,Cred grouse populations, experts say
OL,6,FThe GWCT said the maternal grouse
OL,7,Fproject, which brings together more
OL,8,Fthan four decades of research with
OL,9,Ffield studies of hens, could help them
OL,10,Funderstand what determines grouse
OL,11,Fbreeding success.
OL,13,FIt hopes the findings can then be
OL,14,Ftranslated into practical guidance to
OL,15,Fhelp estates build more resilient
OL,16,Fgrouse populations.
OL,18,FThe announcement comes on August 12 `
OL,19,Fthe so-called "glorious twelfth", when
OL,20,Fthe red grouse shooting season
OL,21,Ftraditionally begins.
OL,26,@{D@OOU{D@`O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
