PN,30904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786506479
OL,3,CStudy could shed light on declines in
OL,4,Cred grouse populations, experts say
OL,6,FNick Hesford, director of GWCT
OL,7,FScotland, said: "For decades we've
OL,8,Fknown what grouse populations are
OL,9,Fdoing because we've monitored them
OL,10,Fconsistently across the uplands.
OL,12,F"What the maternal grouse project
OL,13,Fallows us to understand is why some
OL,14,Fpopulations have remained consistently
OL,15,Flow and what's been driving recent
OL,16,Fdeclines and failures to breed
OL,17,Fsuccessfully.
OL,26,@oD@QOUtD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786506479
OL,3,CStudy could shed light on declines in
OL,4,Cred grouse populations, experts say
OL,6,F"By following individual hens from
OL,7,Fbefore they lay until their chicks
OL,8,Ffledge, we're beginning to uncover how
OL,9,Fnutrition, weather, habitat and
OL,10,Fdisease interact to influence breeding
OL,11,Fsuccess.
OL,13,F"It's a level of understanding that
OL,14,Fsimply hasn't been possible before."
OL,16,FThe study, which is now in its fourth
OL,17,Fyear in northern England, sees
OL,18,Fresearchers capture and radio-tag hens
OL,19,Fin the springtime before carefully
OL,20,Ffollowing them throughout the breeding
OL,21,Fseason.
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOUvD@dO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786506479
OL,3,CStudy could shed light on declines in
OL,4,Cred grouse populations, experts say
OL,6,FIn March, the GWCT caught and tagged
OL,7,F60 hens across four long-standing
OL,8,Fstudy sites in the North Pennines and
OL,9,F51 hens across four new sites in the
OL,10,FHighlands.
OL,12,FThe team monitors nesting attempts,
OL,13,Fegg production, hatch success and
OL,14,Fchick survival while also measuring
OL,15,Fheather quality, cotton grass
OL,16,Fproduction, cranefly emergence,
OL,17,Fweather conditions and parasite
OL,18,Fburdens.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786506479
OL,3,CStudy could shed light on declines in
OL,4,Cred grouse populations, experts say
OL,6,FBy combining these detailed field
OL,7,Fmeasurements with decades of
OL,8,Fpopulation data, the trust hopes to
OL,9,Fidentify the subtle interactions that
OL,10,Fdetermine whether a breeding season
OL,11,Fsucceeds or fails.
OL,13,FThe study expanded into north-east
OL,14,FScotland earlier this year and will
OL,15,Fmove into southern Scotland in 2027,
OL,16,Fallowing researchers to compare
OL,17,Fwhether the drivers of breeding
OL,18,Fsuccess differ between landscapes and
OL,19,Fregions.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786506479
OL,3,CStudy could shed light on declines in
OL,4,Cred grouse populations, experts say
OL,6,FLeah Cloonan, GWCT uplands adviser,
OL,7,Fhas been monitoring red grouse as part
OL,8,Fof the project in the English uplands
OL,9,Ffor the past four years.
OL,11,FShe said the study looks at bird body
OL,12,Fcondition and "parasite burdens", and
OL,13,Falso at the role of habitat and food
OL,14,Fsources, with samples of heather ` the
OL,15,Fbirds' main food source ` analysed in
OL,16,Fthe lead-up to nesting season.
OL,26,@tD@OOUtD@`O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30909
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786506479
OL,3,CStudy could shed light on declines in
OL,4,Cred grouse populations, experts say
OL,6,FShe said once the birds have nested
OL,7,Fand lain eggs, the team then uses
OL,8,Fsmall temperature data loggers to
OL,9,Fmonitor egg temperatures, which tells
OL,10,Fresearchers how many times the hen
OL,11,Fleaves the nest to feed.
OL,13,FShe continued: "Once hatched, we note
OL,14,Fthe number of hatched eggs and we
OL,15,Fstart invertebrate sampling in a
OL,16,Ftypical brood foraging area to assess
OL,17,Fchick food availability in the seven
OL,18,Fdays following hatching.
OL,26,@uD@POU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30910
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786506479
OL,3,CStudy could shed light on declines in
OL,4,Cred grouse populations, experts say
OL,6,F"This year we have introduced a new
OL,7,Felement to the study which is the
OL,8,Fcapture of rainfall data on a site by
OL,9,Fsite basis.
OL,11,F"Damp ground is important for the
OL,12,Femergence of key invertebrate species,
OL,13,Fbut too much rainfall can have a
OL,14,Fdetrimental effect on the survival of
OL,15,Fchicks."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUwD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30911
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786506479
OL,3,CStudy could shed light on declines in
OL,4,Cred grouse populations, experts say
OL,6,FMr Hesford said: "The ultimate aim of
OL,7,Fthe maternal grouse project is to
OL,8,Fidentify factors limiting red grouse
OL,9,Fbreeding success and translating this
OL,10,Finto practical guidance that can help
OL,11,Festates build more resilient grouse
OL,12,Fpopulations and deliver more
OL,13,Fconsistent grouse bags in the years
OL,14,Fahead.
OL,16,F"This understanding will also help
OL,17,Fguide future, modern, sustainable
OL,18,Fgrouse moor management and
OL,19,Fconservation in the face of climate
OL,20,Fchange, poor breeding years and
OL,21,Fincreasing legislation and regulation."
OL,26,@nD@ROUxD@AOU}D@gO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/11
